## SubsidIA Mission
**Goal:** Launch within 3 months before NextGenEU funds deplete.

**Problem:** Spanish homeowners/businesses miss out on €7,000+ per solar installation in unclaimed subsidies due to complexity across 6 layers of incentives.

**Product Tiers:**
1. **Tier 1:** Subsidy Report (€150-250) — instant eligibility matching & PDF report
2. **Tier 2:** Managed Application (€400-600) — pre-filled docs + bureaucratic follow-up
3. **Tier 3:** Installer SaaS (€200-400/month) — embedded in solar proposals
4. **Tier 4:** Managed Until Payment — align incentives perfectly

**Month 1 Goal:** Validate with 3 paying clients for manual reports before building any code.

